          </li>
          <li class="bg-gray-100 p-3 rounded-lg border-l-4 border-accent">
            <div class="font-bold text-primary">
              Cloud Architecture with AWS
            </div>
            <div class="text-sm text-secondary">
              AWS Certified Solutions Architect | 2021
